 of a bloodthirsty hunt. Realistic graphics and fun gameplay mechanics ensure that every encounter with wildlife is a deadly and violent experience.\n\nExplore dangerous adventures in search of lions, hippos, herds of wild boar, furious crocodiles, deer, rabbits and variety of birds. Each hunt will be a battle for survival, with dangerous animals ready to fight to the end.", "short_description": "If you're the type who enjoys adrenaline and lots of fun, you're in the right place.\nExplore dangerous adventures in search of lions, hippos, herds of wild boar, crocodiles, deer, rabbits and various birds. Challenge your hunting instincts by diving into these wild adventures, feeling the thrill of chasing incredible prey!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://codelab.megatextos.com.br/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fernando Dib Gon\u00e7alves", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://codelab.megatextos.com.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23903665909280233"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2462364674175314"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2144939166324923"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "897457559273779"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1213025660126145"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1297912664231383"}, {"sta